OL,3,GNEWSAHow the police track down missing
OL,4,Apeople
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands of people go missing
OL,7,Facross the UK every year, with Thames
OL,8,FValley Police alone dealing with about
OL,9,F16,000 cases.
OL,11,FThe force receives approximately 10,000
OL,12,Fmissing person reports and a further
OL,13,F6,000 missing-related incidents that do
OL,14,Fnot meet the threshold for a full
OL,15,Finvestigation.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
