OL,3,GNEWSAHow the police track down missing
OL,4,Apeople
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn any given day, between 10 and 30
OL,7,Fpeople are listed as missing across the
OL,8,Fforce area. The reasons can be varied
OL,9,Fbut, in each case recorded, an
OL,10,Finvestigation will be launched to help
OL,11,Ffind that person and ensure their
OL,12,Fsafety.
OL,14,FThe BBC has been speaking with the
OL,15,Fforce's Missing Investigation Support
OL,16,FTeam (MIST) about the work that goes
OL,17,Finto tracking these people across
OL,18,FBerkshire, Buckinghamshire and
OL,19,FOxfordshire.
